  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Investec Africa Credit Opportunities Fund 1 (IACO), sub-Saharan Africa&#x2019;s first corporate debt fund, will provide long-term capital to businesses of different sizes and sectors across a wide range of countries in the region (excluding South Africa).The fund aims to kick-start the development of African debt capital markets and to invest in sustainable businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
